A posting or price uses a commodity before its declaration.

========== API ==========

accounts({})

========== FILE ==========

account Assets:Cash
account Equity:Opening
2024-01-01 Opening
  Assets:Cash  1 SEK
  Equity:Opening
commodity SEK
  format 1,000.00 SEK
  default

========== WARNINGS ==========

[UNDECLARED_COMMODITY] Commodity SEK must be declared before use
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:4:3
